   "name": "export_filing_timeliness",
   "description": "Grain: one row per filer group, form (10-K or 10-Q) and period year: original filings on time, within a late-filing notice's extension, and late; how long filers took (exact medians per group); the group's deadline and extension in days. Notices are known only from 2025 (notice_data_available): earlier years count filings that used an extension as late, so only on-time against not on-time compares across all years.",
